sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Developer
  participant C as CLI / VS Code
  participant R as Registry (static JSON)
  participant L as Bundled catalog
  U->>C: expo-snips add auth/login
  C->>C: getRegistryBase(override)
  alt remote base configured
    C->>R: GET {base}/index.json (timeout 10s)
    R-->>C: RecipeIndexEntry[]
    C->>R: GET {base}/recipes/auth%2Flogin.json
    R-->>C: ScreenRecipe (templates inlined)
  else no base or fetch failed
    C->>L: getLocalRecipeById(id)
    L-->>C: ScreenRecipe
  end
  C-->>U: Generated files
